        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Charles Burnett, Alan J. Pakula\n- Works: To Sleep with Anger\n- Roles: film director, producer, writer, editor, actor, photographer, cinematographer\n\nFacts:\n- Alan J. Pakula was born on April 7, 1928, and was an American film director, writer, and producer.\n- Charles Burnett was born on April 13, 1944, in Vicksburg, Mississippi, and is an African-American film director, film producer, writer, editor, actor, photographer, and cinematographer.\n- To Sleep with Anger is a 1990 American drama film that was directed and written by Charles Burnett.\n- Alan J. Pakula died on November 19, 1998.",
